; ============================================================
;  THE THREE STOCK POUCHES, RETIRED AS FAR AS THIS SET CAN RETIRE THEM
;
;  af_magpouch_s/m/l belong to the MAGAZINE MOD, not to Squared Away
;  and not to us. They cannot be deleted:
;
;    - the eleven pouches above INHERIT them, and a child of a section
;      that does not exist is a section that does not exist
;    - mag_limit_small/medium/large live on them, and that is what a
;      rig reads before it will accept any pouch at all
;    - they are in saves, on corpses and in trader inventories
;
;  So they are hidden rather than removed. Already done elsewhere:
;  tier 5 in the stash tables, which the stash mod never rolls; and
;  the rig recipes no longer ask for them, so nothing needs them.
;  Here they are sent to a spawner branch that says what they are.
;
;  WHAT THIS SET CANNOT REACH: traders, whose lines are in the
;  magazine mod's own files, and corpses - those are the three pouch
;  sliders per rank in Squared Away's MCM. Set those to 0 and they
;  stop dropping.
; ============================================================

![af_magpouch_s]
$spawn = "equipment\zz retired\magazine pouch small"

![af_magpouch_m]
$spawn = "equipment\zz retired\magazine pouch medium"

![af_magpouch_l]
$spawn = "equipment\zz retired\magazine pouch large"
